@Becoming.«所闭之自反» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R : Becoming.«际» α) (x : α), Becoming.«所闭» R x x
@Becoming.«所闭之传递» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R : Becoming.«际» α} {x y z : α},
  Becoming.«所闭» R x y → Becoming.«所闭» R y z → Becoming.«所闭» R x z
