  Becoming.«闭» R P → ∀ {x y : α}, P x → Becoming.«及» R x y → P y
@Becoming.«及之所闭» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R : Becoming.«际» α}, Becoming.«则» (Becoming.«及» R) (Becoming.«所闭» R)
@Becoming.«所闭当且仅当同一或及» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R : Becoming.«际» α} {x y : α},
  Becoming.«所闭» R x y ↔ x = y ∨ Becoming.«及» R x y
@Becoming.«及当且仅当一步而所闭» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R : Becoming.«际» α} {x z : α},
  Becoming.«及» R x z ↔ ∃ y, R x y ∧ Becoming.«所闭» R y z
