  (∀ (x y : α), R' x y → R x y ∨ x = o ∧ R a y) → Becoming.«所闭» R' o g → Becoming.«所闭» R o g ∨ Becoming.«所闭» R a g
@Becoming.«二所闭在借步之所闭» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R R' : Becoming.«际» α} {o a g : α},
